{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "v1.7.0.4", "body": [{"from": 0.04, "to": 2.86, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "上次的瞄准热身教程的这个反响非常不错啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 2.86, "to": 4.97, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "在全网的播放和收藏率都很高", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 4.97, "to": 8.21, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "那么这期呢出一期关于很多人都会遇到的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 8.21, "to": 9.69, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "瞄准瓶颈的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 9.69, "to": 10.81, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "想提升", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 10.81, "to": 12.97, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "想让我出一期关于练枪的这个教程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 12.97, "to": 13.73, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "那么这期视频的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 13.73, "to": 15.66, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "就给大家讲一讲我的练枪方式啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 15.66, "to": 18.98, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "不算特别正式的这个特别科学的瞄准教程啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 18.98, "to": 20.64, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "算是跟大家交流学习一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 20.64, "to": 22.07, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "OK那我们直接开始", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 22.07, "to": 24.27, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "我个人认为的强化瞄准训练啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 24.27, "to": 25.51, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "首先最重要的是", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.51, "to": 28.09, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "我觉得你要找到一个适合自己的一个灵敏度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 28.09, "to": 30.29, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "和找出你的瞄准方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 30.29, "to": 31.81, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "你擅长的瞄准方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.81, "to": 32.67, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "这个很重要", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 32.67, "to": 34.04, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "来演示一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 34.04, "to": 37.2, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "OK啊我现在的灵敏度是1600dpi", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 37.2, "to": 38.82, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "然后游戏内是0.245", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 38.82, "to": 41.5, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "然后我以前的游戏灵敏度是800dpi", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 41.5, "to": 42.55, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "0.283", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 42.55, "to": 45.43, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "就是我完全照搬beng fish使用的一个灵敏度啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 45.43, "to": 47.19, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "然后这个灵敏度其实是有讲究的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 47.19, "to": 49.49, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "就是你离显示器稍微近一点的距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 49.49, "to": 51.72, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "然后你看游戏内的这个视野啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 51.72, "to": 53.26, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "从中间拼一个点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 53.26, "to": 56.2, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "然后我从中间到我视野的边缘诶", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 56.2, "to": 58.95, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "刚好这个距离就是我手腕拉过去", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 58.95, "to": 61.14, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "极限拉到拉不动的一个距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 61.14, "to": 62.54, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "唉然后他就会停在这里", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 62.54, "to": 63.8, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "就再拉拉不动了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 63.8, "to": 66.69, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "就是你体感上会感觉到你的手腕", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 66.69, "to": 68.13, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "拉都拉不动的位置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 68.13, "to": 70.92, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "刚好就是卡在游戏内这个视野的边缘", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 70.92, "to": 73.92, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "然后这个灵敏度我玩了大概有一年半啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 73.92, "to": 75.5, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "它会影响你的瞄准方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 75.5, "to": 77.6, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "我们一般瞄准不是分三步吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.6, "to": 78.84, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "移动鼠标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 78.84, "to": 82.16, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "然后确认鼠标准星有没有在敌人的头部", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 82.16, "to": 83.28, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "然后如果说没有的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 83.28, "to": 84.4, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "我们再微调再开一下吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 84.4, "to": 85.06, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "就这三步", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 85.06, "to": 86.8, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "但是我用这个800.283", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 86.8, "to": 87.72, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "这个灵敏度的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 87.72, "to": 91.58, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "我大部分时候就是会学bi bi那样看到人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 91.58, "to": 93.7, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "然后鼠标甩过去就已经在点左键了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 93.7, "to": 96.36, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "这样的射击方式会让你的击杀效率特别高", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 96.36, "to": 99.85, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "就是你确实会感觉到中低敏的秒杀速度特别快", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 99.85, "to": 103.09, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "但是它在实战里面对我来说它不是很稳定啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 103.09, "to": 104.61, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "因为这个灵敏度玩久了之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 104.61, "to": 105.69, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "我还感觉到一个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 105.69, "to": 107.2, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "就是我的手腕的微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 107.2, "to": 108.64, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "我其实已经不怎么动了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 108.64, "to": 110.32, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "大部分就是手臂甩过去", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 110.32, "to": 112.4, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "然后就已经开始打神经枪那种感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 112.4, "to": 115.08, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "然后有一段时间呢就是感觉到瞄准瓶颈了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 115.08, "to": 116.56, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "哎这个时候我就意识到一个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 116.56, "to": 119.95, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "就是我以前的瞄准他就不太适合用这种中低敏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 119.95, "to": 121.88, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "而且我握鼠标的力度又比较轻", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 121.88, "to": 124.24, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "而且我现在离显示器的距离又比较远", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 124.24, "to": 126.48, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "体感上我的视野是更大一点的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 126.48, "to": 127.76, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "不知道怎么找灵敏度的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 127.76, "to": 128.44, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "可以参考一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 128.44, "to": 131.889, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "我的办法就是找一个你看着舒服的显示器距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 131.889, "to": 134.35, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "然后你把手腕拉到拉不动的距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 134.35, "to": 137.43, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "在真实视野的体感上差不多90度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 137.43, "to": 139.65, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "这个样子不是游戏内的视野啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 139.65, "to": 141.77, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "然后我们就可以固定这个显示器的距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 141.77, "to": 142.77, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "以及你的灵敏度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 142.77, "to": 143.61, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "不要经常换啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 143.61, "to": 144.95, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "经常换的话会废的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 144.95, "to": 147.03, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "那么怎么快速适应你的灵敏度呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 147.03, "to": 149.12, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "哎就直接看我的热身教程就行了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 149.12, "to": 152.54, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "那我这期视频的主题主要是讲突破瞄准瓶颈啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 152.54, "to": 153.88, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "除了找灵敏度以外", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 153.88, "to": 157.069, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "第二个让我突破的原因就是我换了显示器啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 157.069, "to": 160.329, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "显示器这个刷新率也是能改变你瞄准方式的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 160.329, "to": 162.649, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "也是能提高你瞄准上限的啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 162.649, "to": 165.57, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "我现在用的是卓威的这个400HZ的显示器", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 165.57, "to": 167.97, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "然后也是用了一段时间了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 167.97, "to": 170.72, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "这个瞄准方式最近是有在变化的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 170.72, "to": 174.22, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "老粉呢应该知道我之前用的一直是老款的卓威", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 174.22, "to": 176.2, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "240HZ的显示器啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 176.2, "to": 178.18, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "以前玩其他FPS的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 178.18, "to": 181.02, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "就是遇到瞄准瓶颈期的时候买的这个时期", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 181.02, "to": 182.42, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "这个2020年这个时期", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 182.42, "to": 185.34, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "很多人连一款高刷显示器都没有", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 185.34, "to": 188.26, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "然后我看身边的朋友和很多职业都在用", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 188.26, "to": 189.74, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "然后就入了他们的同款", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 189.74, "to": 191.38, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "年初的时候我看nice直播", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 191.38, "to": 194.54, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "他这个左上角的锁帧突然就变成了360", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 194.54, "to": 197.26, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "他之前一直用的都是240HZ的显示器", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 197.26, "to": 198.62, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "然后我就去查啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 198.62, "to": 201.36, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "发现他哎他也换了这个卓威的400HZ显示器", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 201.36, "to": 203.9, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "我原本那款显示器就是刚刚图片给你们看的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 203.9, "to": 205.38, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "2020年买的这款显示器", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 205.38, "to": 206.73, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "我用了6年", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 206.73, "to": 210.37, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "然后到今年8月份我才换了新款的卓威啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 210.37, "to": 211.89, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "这个这个现在这个新款的卓威", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 211.89, "to": 213.36, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "除了刷新率上的差距", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 213.36, "to": 215.0, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "还有这个DYAC升级吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 215.0, "to": 216.78, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "现在我一直开着这个DYAC2", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 216.78, "to": 218.96, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "它这个动态清晰度会更好一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 218.96, "to": 220.96, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "就是开了这个DYC2之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 220.96, "to": 221.88, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "压枪的弹道", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 221.88, "to": 223.899, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "你明显能感觉到能控住很多", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 223.899, "to": 225.679, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "所以我现在一直都用的卓威", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 225.679, "to": 227.599, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "用别的都没有这种瞄准手感", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 227.599, "to": 229.5, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "用别的可能你的瞄准方式都会变", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 229.5, "to": 230.6, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "因为用久了嘛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 230.6, "to": 232.04, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "他这个拖影也很少", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 232.04, "to": 235.14, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "然后瞄准也比较跟手命中的确认感也很明显", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 235.14, "to": 236.5, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "反正对我自己来说的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 236.5, "to": 238.83, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "就是作为FPS领域的主播", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 238.83, "to": 240.91, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "这个卓威电竞显示器的这个方向", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 240.91, "to": 242.63, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "确实是独一档啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 242.63, "to": 244.31, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "大家如果说有卓威显示器的用户", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 244.31, "to": 246.07, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "也可以评论区说说感受", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 246.07, "to": 248.51, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "因为我现在用的显示器跟nice是同款啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 248.51, "to": 250.99, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "然后我就直接把他的灵敏度给照搬过来了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 250.99, "to": 252.91, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "我的EDPI现在是跟他是完全一样的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 252.91, "to": 254.42, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "我的鼠标也跟他是同款", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 254.42, "to": 256.58, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "我们再来讲一下这个瞄准方式啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 256.58, "to": 259.18, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "刚刚说的这个800.283这个灵敏度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 259.18, "to": 260.74, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "它算是一个中低敏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 260.74, "to": 262.72, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "其实还有更低敏的可以参考", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 262.72, "to": 264.26, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "就是deon one的这个灵敏度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 264.26, "to": 265.93, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "1600×0.1", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 265.93, "to": 267.41, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "他这个灵敏度是怎么样的呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 267.41, "to": 269.11, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "你看我这个鼠标在中间不动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 269.11, "to": 271.87, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "然后我手腕拉到拉不动的一个位置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 271.87, "to": 274.0, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "可以发现这个角度更小", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 274.0, "to": 276.8, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "DEMONE它离这个显示器的距离很近啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 276.8, "to": 279.34, "sid": 135, "location": 2, "content": "可以说完全把头贴到屏幕去玩的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 279.34, "to": 281.38, "sid": 136, "location": 2, "content": "所以我猜测他鼠标拉都拉不动的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 281.38, "to": 284.22, "sid": 137, "location": 2, "content": "这个位置其实也是跟他视野的边缘差不多", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 284.22, "to": 285.86, "sid": 138, "location": 2, "content": "然后他看小地图的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 285.86, "to": 287.5, "sid": 139, "location": 2, "content": "他甚至会移动头部", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 287.5, "to": 289.94, "sid": 140, "location": 2, "content": "正常来说我们眼睛一瞥就看到小地图了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 289.94, "to": 290.26, "sid": 141, "location": 2, "content": "对不对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 290.26, "to": 292.7, "sid": 142, "location": 2, "content": "但是由于它这个显示器的距离实在是太近了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 292.7, "to": 293.64, "sid": 143, "location": 2, "content": "就很极端", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 293.64, "to": 295.0, "sid": 144, "location": 2, "content": "跟他一样的低敏玩家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 295.0, "to": 297.09, "sid": 145, "location": 2, "content": "可以参考一下他的瞄准方式啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 297.09, "to": 299.53, "sid": 146, "location": 2, "content": "他是用手臂去做大幅度的移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 299.53, "to": 301.29, "sid": 147, "location": 2, "content": "例如说转身和背闪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 301.29, "to": 302.61, "sid": 148, "location": 2, "content": "然后在准备好对枪的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 302.61, "to": 304.549, "sid": 149, "location": 2, "content": "这个时候他只会移动他的手腕", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 304.549, "to": 306.45, "sid": 150, "location": 2, "content": "去做很快速的一次定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 306.45, "to": 308.21, "sid": 151, "location": 2, "content": "对于这种超低敏的玩家来说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 308.21, "to": 309.13, "sid": 152, "location": 2, "content": "整个对枪过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 309.13, "to": 312.05, "sid": 153, "location": 2, "content": "他都不怎么需要去用眼睛去做二次定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 312.05, "to": 314.37, "sid": 154, "location": 2, "content": "很多时候就是手臂调整到大概的区域", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 314.37, "to": 316.97, "sid": 155, "location": 2, "content": "然后看到人加上瞄准直接开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 316.97, "to": 319.26, "sid": 156, "location": 2, "content": "整个设计过程都是他的射击甜区", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 319.26, "to": 320.82, "sid": 157, "location": 2, "content": "什么是射击甜区呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 320.82, "to": 322.62, "sid": 158, "location": 2, "content": "简单来说就是你的手腕移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 322.62, "to": 324.06, "sid": 159, "location": 2, "content": "你的鼠标最舒服", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 324.06, "to": 325.86, "sid": 160, "location": 2, "content": "微调最准最稳定", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 325.86, "to": 328.51, "sid": 161, "location": 2, "content": "最不容易抖的一小块瞄准区域", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 328.51, "to": 330.59, "sid": 162, "location": 2, "content": "现在我用低敏给大家演示一下啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 330.59, "to": 331.93, "sid": 163, "location": 2, "content": "就是我打这两个bot", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 331.93, "to": 333.39, "sid": 164, "location": 2, "content": "他们之间的距离很近", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 333.39, "to": 336.789, "sid": 165, "location": 2, "content": "我眼睛甚至都不需要确认我能不能打到再开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 336.789, "to": 338.109, "sid": 166, "location": 2, "content": "因为我知道怎么样发力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 338.109, "to": 340.24, "sid": 167, "location": 2, "content": "我就能直接点到第二个bot的头", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 340.24, "to": 342.48, "sid": 168, "location": 2, "content": "这种用瞄准田区的射击方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 342.48, "to": 343.2, "sid": 169, "location": 2, "content": "在实战里面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 343.2, "to": 345.06, "sid": 170, "location": 2, "content": "它就是击杀效率最快的一种", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 345.06, "to": 346.73, "sid": 171, "location": 2, "content": "对面甚至开不出枪来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 346.73, "to": 348.17, "sid": 172, "location": 2, "content": "但是别忘了无畏契约", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 348.17, "to": 349.71, "sid": 173, "location": 2, "content": "他是有空枪惩罚的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 349.71, "to": 351.95, "sid": 174, "location": 2, "content": "就是如果你直接进行射击诶", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 351.95, "to": 353.48, "sid": 175, "location": 2, "content": "打不中怎么办呢对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 353.48, "to": 355.64, "sid": 176, "location": 2, "content": "所以我们就需要慢慢的让自己这个瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 355.64, "to": 357.19, "sid": 177, "location": 2, "content": "填区稳定啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 357.19, "to": 359.01, "sid": 178, "location": 2, "content": "很多人感觉今天唉没手感什么的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 359.01, "to": 359.57, "sid": 179, "location": 2, "content": "这是为什么呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 359.57, "to": 362.429, "sid": 180, "location": 2, "content": "就是很多时候你的瞄准分配的地方就有问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 362.429, "to": 364.309, "sid": 181, "location": 2, "content": "比如说有的时候你该背闪的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 364.309, "to": 365.829, "sid": 182, "location": 2, "content": "你用手腕瞄准去背", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 365.829, "to": 367.029, "sid": 183, "location": 2, "content": "然后猛地一转回来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 367.029, "to": 369.349, "sid": 184, "location": 2, "content": "你这个手整个手腕僵住了对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 369.349, "to": 370.96, "sid": 185, "location": 2, "content": "或者你大幅度的预瞄", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 370.96, "to": 373.22, "sid": 186, "location": 2, "content": "比如说你想从一楼预瞄到这个二楼", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 373.22, "to": 374.56, "sid": 187, "location": 2, "content": "然后再开枪打人对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 374.56, "to": 376.8, "sid": 188, "location": 2, "content": "你直接用手腕去拉到这个二楼", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 376.8, "to": 378.75, "sid": 189, "location": 2, "content": "这个时候你鼠标往上一抬", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 378.75, "to": 379.43, "sid": 190, "location": 2, "content": "哎僵住了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 379.43, "to": 381.39, "sid": 191, "location": 2, "content": "你没有办法做这个填区射击了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 381.39, "to": 383.31, "sid": 192, "location": 2, "content": "这个就是很多人都会遇到的一个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 383.31, "to": 385.85, "sid": 193, "location": 2, "content": "就是你的瞄准发力分配就有问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 385.85, "to": 386.93, "sid": 194, "location": 2, "content": "反过来也一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 386.93, "to": 388.99, "sid": 195, "location": 2, "content": "就是你的手臂去做瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 388.99, "to": 389.77, "sid": 196, "location": 2, "content": "玩久了之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 389.77, "to": 391.37, "sid": 197, "location": 2, "content": "你的手腕都不知道该怎么发力了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 391.37, "to": 392.51, "sid": 198, "location": 2, "content": "就也僵住了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 392.51, "to": 394.51, "sid": 199, "location": 2, "content": "这个是这期视频很重要的一个概念啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 394.51, "to": 396.23, "sid": 200, "location": 2, "content": "大家遇到这个瞄准瓶颈的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 396.23, "to": 398.82, "sid": 201, "location": 2, "content": "一定要意识到发力分配的这个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 398.82, "to": 401.14, "sid": 202, "location": 2, "content": "当你意识到发力分配的问题的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 401.14, "to": 402.98, "sid": 203, "location": 2, "content": "自然而然你就会稳定很多了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 402.98, "to": 404.38, "sid": 204, "location": 2, "content": "OK最后我们再来说一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 404.38, "to": 406.76, "sid": 205, "location": 2, "content": "这个超高敏的瞄准发力方式啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 406.76, "to": 409.18, "sid": 206, "location": 2, "content": "我看很多的博主都不会去讲这个", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 409.18, "to": 411.96, "sid": 207, "location": 2, "content": "就是很多宿舍玩家因为这个桌面比较小嘛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 411.96, "to": 412.74, "sid": 208, "location": 2, "content": "伸展不开", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 412.74, "to": 413.34, "sid": 209, "location": 2, "content": "灵敏度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 413.34, "to": 416.66, "sid": 210, "location": 2, "content": "有的一千六零.4这样子的这种超高敏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 416.66, "to": 418.6, "sid": 211, "location": 2, "content": "也有打的特别厉害的职业选手", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 418.6, "to": 421.32, "sid": 212, "location": 2, "content": "像something happy way这种这种超高敏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 421.32, "to": 423.0, "sid": 213, "location": 2, "content": "其实我不太推荐去学啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 423.0, "to": 424.789, "sid": 214, "location": 2, "content": "完全就是天赋怪来的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 424.789, "to": 427.149, "sid": 215, "location": 2, "content": "我有去观察过他们的这个鼠标握姿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 427.149, "to": 429.449, "sid": 216, "location": 2, "content": "他们的预瞄和背闪和瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 429.449, "to": 431.8, "sid": 217, "location": 2, "content": "所有动作基本上都是用手腕进行的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 431.8, "to": 434.56, "sid": 218, "location": 2, "content": "而且他们都有经常需要用到台鼠复位的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 434.56, "to": 435.38, "sid": 219, "location": 2, "content": "这么一个情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 435.38, "to": 437.28, "sid": 220, "location": 2, "content": "这种抬鼠复位对于高敏来说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 437.28, "to": 438.95, "sid": 221, "location": 2, "content": "其实也是在找瞄准田区", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 438.95, "to": 440.31, "sid": 222, "location": 2, "content": "大部分超高敏的玩家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 440.31, "to": 442.91, "sid": 223, "location": 2, "content": "他们的瞄准系统跟我们普通人都不太一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 442.91, "to": 445.68, "sid": 224, "location": 2, "content": "他们打头就像点击桌面上的一个图标一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 445.68, "to": 448.0, "sid": 225, "location": 2, "content": "这种就需要你有很强的这个动态视力啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 448.0, "to": 451.34, "sid": 226, "location": 2, "content": "但是我们大部分人都没有那么强的鼠标掌控感", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 451.34, "to": 453.18, "sid": 227, "location": 2, "content": "所以这种就不会很稳定", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 453.18, "to": 454.5, "sid": 228, "location": 2, "content": "我能给的建议就是", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 454.5, "to": 455.94, "sid": 229, "location": 2, "content": "如果你是个超高敏的玩家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 455.94, "to": 456.76, "sid": 230, "location": 2, "content": "想提升", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 456.76, "to": 458.72, "sid": 231, "location": 2, "content": "那你还是最好降一点灵敏度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 458.72, "to": 460.3, "sid": 232, "location": 2, "content": "控制好你的发力分配", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 460.3, "to": 461.28, "sid": 233, "location": 2, "content": "OK说到这里", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 461.28, "to": 463.9, "sid": 234, "location": 2, "content": "大家应该知道怎么去突破瞄准瓶颈了吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 463.9, "to": 466.65, "sid": 235, "location": 2, "content": "其实就是去做针对的瞄准强化训练", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 466.65, "to": 467.93, "sid": 236, "location": 2, "content": "比如说你手腕瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 467.93, "to": 469.63, "sid": 237, "location": 2, "content": "你的手腕协调能力很差", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 469.63, "to": 471.45, "sid": 238, "location": 2, "content": "那我建议你去点一点小球", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 471.45, "to": 472.67, "sid": 239, "location": 2, "content": "打一打侧面100把", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 472.67, "to": 474.25, "sid": 240, "location": 2, "content": "这样子肯定是有提升的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 474.25, "to": 475.95, "sid": 241, "location": 2, "content": "然后如果说你是一个手臂流", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 475.95, "to": 478.4, "sid": 242, "location": 2, "content": "那你就要注意好你的发力分配方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 478.4, "to": 480.96, "sid": 243, "location": 2, "content": "有些地方你去找一下你的瞄准填区", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 480.96, "to": 483.48, "sid": 244, "location": 2, "content": "不要让你那个手腕一整个僵住去", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 483.48, "to": 485.95, "sid": 245, "location": 2, "content": "尽量找到掌控鼠标的那种感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 485.95, "to": 488.17, "sid": 246, "location": 2, "content": "然后手臂流我建议多练一练跟枪啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 488.17, "to": 490.53, "sid": 247, "location": 2, "content": "我们可以把这个靶场的人物移动打开", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 490.53, "to": 493.77, "sid": 248, "location": 2, "content": "练跟枪也能提升你的这个微调能力的好了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 493.77, "to": 495.25, "sid": 249, "location": 2, "content": "希望这期视频对大家有帮助啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 495.25, "to": 497.53, "sid": 250, "location": 2, "content": "如果说还有什么问题可以在评论区问主播", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 497.53, "to": 499.09, "sid": 251, "location": 2, "content": "大家互相交流学习一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 499.09, "to": 500.52, "sid": 252, "location": 2, "content": "感谢你的观看", "music": 0.0}], "bvid": "BV1SLeB6LEkV", "title": "打瓦经常没手感？新手快速突破瞄准瓶颈的教程来了", "owner": "P1odx912", "duration": 501}